FightAreaSouthHouse_Text_Npc1:
	.string "I am the Item Expert!\nI have mastery in the way of items!\pYour Pokémon...\nDo they hold items?\pThe better the item they hold, the \nstronger they become.\pThere are items that are worthy of my\nrecommendation. Care to know?$"

